*

# Share GitNexus navigation artifacts (wiki, metadata, runner) so viewers get a
# working code-intelligence map. The large local database (lbug, ~283MB) and the
# parser caches (parse-cache, parsedfile-cache) stay out of git -- the database is
# distributed via GitHub Releases instead; run ./fetch-db.sh from this directory
# to download it. Re-create everything locally with `bun run gitnexus:analyze`.
!.gitignore
!run.cjs
!meta.json
!update-document-index.cjs
!wiki/
!wiki/**
!fetch-db.sh
!DOWNLOAD-DB.md
